-- הסכם אופק חדש (25.12.2008), §89: parts כא–כב apply also to a first deputy
-- of a regional support centre or of a large or very large teachers'
-- centre — on a primary school's first deputy's terms — and to the head of
-- a Pais cluster — on a junior high school's.

IMPORT prelude
IMPORT common

§ `89`

DECLARE `post under section 89` IS ONE OF
    `a first deputy of a regional support centre`
    `a first deputy of a large or very large teachers' centre`
    `the head of a Pais cluster`

-- akn:art_89 The opening: parts כא–כב apply to the posts (א)–(ב) name.

@ref akn:art_89__para_a akn:art_89__para_b
GIVEN p IS A `post under section 89`
GIVETH A `school stage`
DECIDE `the first deputy whose terms apply` p IS
    IF p EQUALS `the head of a Pais cluster` THEN `a junior high school` ELSE `a primary school`

#ASSERT `the first deputy whose terms apply` `the head of a Pais cluster` EQUALS `a junior high school`
